Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: git, openssh-client, ca-certificates, sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Ahmadlolbit/solanumos
Description: Hyprland on Debian, set up properly
 SolanumOS sets up Hyprland on Debian 13 with a guided setup, sensible
 defaults and real options, and keeps a snapshot before every change.
 .
 The package puts a clone of the release in /opt/solanum, with its
 programs already built; solanum update moves it to newer signed
 releases.
